WFDB-x is an independent reimplementation of the WFDB Software Package,
version 10.7.0 (the library and the command-line tools), in Python, C++,
Rust, Julia, R, MATLAB/Octave and Kotlin. Its code in each language is a
translation of the C code of the package, written for WFDB-x. The original
WFDB Software Package is Copyright (C) 1983-2022 George B. Moody and the
WFDB contributors; its library is distributed under the GNU Library General
Public License, version 2 or later, and its tools under the GNU General
Public License, version 2 or later. The authors of the original C code are
credited in each source file and in docs/AUTHORS.md.


